   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Projections start from small random weights (std 0.005), biases at zero. Why drop the final MLP? Pre-MLP features are\nknown to carry semantic similarity (FreeRet); the ablation on slide 20 shows no loss.",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 5,
